// Data of the theorem graph (theorems.html): theorems, lemmas, corollaries and conjectures of the calculus of
// variations and optimal control, MSC 2020 49. In English. Built on 3 November 2026. No theorem with a first class 49
// stood in another folder.
//
// Model as in ../../algebraic-number-theory/data/theorem-graph.js (see its header comment): `premises` and `proof` are
